    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                329,
                70,
                901,
                101
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Bank operating accounts, cash, bonds, fixed term deposits and term.deposits;",
            "block_bbox": [
                250,
                178,
                1016,
                238
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e.Direct property and listed property,",
            "block_bbox": [
                250,
                272,
                671,
                304
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f.Collectibles and Art; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                249,
                334,
                562,
                362
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Other authorised investments.",
            "block_bbox": [
                247,
                398,
                607,
                423
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All contributions are allocated to the Member who actually contributes those assets towards the Fund. All net investment earnings are allocated to members on a pro rata basis. An individual Member account must be kept for each Member. Investment earnings should be allocated to Members on a time-weighted basis.",
            "block_bbox": [
                122,
                452,
                1034,
                579
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "15. How Benefits (Pension or Lump Sum) can be made in compliance with SISA Requirements:",
            "block_bbox": [
                164,
                674,
                1066,
                732
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. When a Member reaches retirement age, and Conditions of Release (as detailed at 17(b)) have been met, Benefits can be paid out to the Member..",
            "block_bbox": [
                238,
                800,
                1061,
                859
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Benefits can be paid out as a lump sum, or as a regular income stream.",
            "block_bbox": [
                236,
                893,
                1029,
                922
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "16. When Benefits can be paid to Members:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                159,
                1016,
                652,
                1040
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The preserved benefit held on account for each Member must not be paid.out by the Trustees when prohibited by superannuation law..",
            "block_bbox": [
                234,
                1108,
                1060,
                1165
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The preserved benefit can only be paid out to a Member when the.Australian Tax Office (ATO) \"Conditions of Release' have been met..These conditions include reaching preservation age, permanent incapacity or on compassionate grounds.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                233,
                1198,
                1064,
                1316
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Any restricted or unrestricted non-preserved benefit can be paid out when the conditions set under the SISA are satisfied..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                233,
                1351,
                1059,
                1405
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Members are permitted to pay Life Insurance premiums from their Member balances.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                234,
                1442,
                984,
                1497
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
